    LLM: 'Game: 98. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '98: adding game. Play one card to a central pile and announce new total. A-9 add face value; 10 subtracts 10; J/Q no change; K sets pile to 98. Avoid exceeding 98; first to push total over 98 loses. Often played as drinking game.',
    objective: 'Avoid being the player who pushes the central total over 98.',
